# Networking Task

Task: Configure a system-wide HTTP proxy through environment variables.

In `/etc/environment`, define:

- `http_proxy` set to `http://{{proxy_host}}:{{proxy_port}}`
- `https_proxy` set to `http://{{proxy_host}}:{{proxy_port}}`
- `no_proxy` containing the entries `{{no_proxy}}`

The settings must apply to new login sessions and must persist across reboots. Do not remove existing entries from the file.
